# Plan 17.1 Summary: Wire API Surfaces for Context, User Counters, and Time-Aware nextPair

## Objective
Implement the missing public API surfaces: context visibility in status, per-user vote counts, and backward-compatible `nextPair({ now? })` support.

## Work Completed

### Task 1: Extended public types and engine status output
- Added `ContextSummary` type with `labels`, `keys`, and `keyValues` read-only maps
- Extended `EngineStatus` with `perUserVoteCounts: ReadonlyMap<UserId, number>` and `contextSummary: ContextSummary`
- Updated `Engine.status(now?)` to aggregate event log by userId and context in real-time
- All existing status fields remain unchanged and type-compatible

**Files modified:**
- `packages/core/src/types.ts` — added new types
- `packages/core/src/engine/engine.ts` — implemented aggregation logic in status()

### Task 2: Added context filter helper and time-aware nextPair signature
- Changed `nextPair()` signature to `nextPair(opts?: { now?: number }): PairRecommendation`
- Backward-compatible: zero-argument calls work unchanged
- Added `filterByContext(key: string)` helper that returns a read-only `EngineContextView`
- Filtered view is derived and does not mutate base engine state
- Updated `SelectorContext` to include `now` parameter and propagate through pair scoring

**Files modified:**
- `packages/core/src/engine/engine.ts` — nextPair signature, filterByContext implementation
- `packages/core/src/selector/selector.ts` — accept now in context, pass to model.predict/get calls
- `packages/core/src/index.ts` — export new types
- `packages/core/test/engine/api-completeness.test.ts` — 3 focused tests covering all API surfaces

## Test Results
- ✅ api-completeness tests: 3/3 passing
- ✅ All existing engine tests remain passing (8/8)
- ✅ No type errors

## Verification Criteria
- [x] `EngineStatus` includes per-user vote count surface
- [x] Context data is visible and queryable through public API
- [x] `nextPair({ now })` is supported with no regression for existing callers
- [x] Focused API tests passing
